                                "sense_id": "ea5148be-6d99-394e-8972-5b82756f2f7b",
                                "text": "On shore I could see the glow of the great campfire burning warmly through the shoreside trees."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cee3b6b-f9aa-45ea-8591-7521f53c47bf",
                                "sense_id": "ea5148be-6d99-394e-8972-5b82756f2f7b",
                                "text": "What were once shoreside amenities now stand forlornly in the middle of the desert, a 300-yard hike from the beach."
